4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;background-size: 16px auto !important;height: 411.214815px !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;background-size: 16px auto !important;height: 419.363889px !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;background-size: 16px auto !important;height: 902.666667px !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n          亚马逊区域在秘鲁北边，是上图红色部分，图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n           关于小熊农场\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           小熊农场\n           <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            坐落于阿尤尤斯地区 (Ayuyos) 纽约 (Nueva York) 小村落，海拔1800米的崇山峻岭之间。毗邻孔多尔普纳 (Condor Puna) 区级自然保护区让我们深感幸运——这片生物多样性宝库孕育着蓬勃的动植物群落，正是滋养我们土地的溪流源头所在；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHV6eTiaPsHKc7FSdLT3k9nBPEWGeFZcOuwAJ3Ot8KvIcnhGZN1J7Prhug/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           农场最初是一片自然的牧场，夫妻二人皆出身于生产者家庭，如今他们正在缔造自己的传奇，不仅精心培育咖啡，更悉心养育着两个年幼的孩子——聪慧的十三岁女儿与活力充沛的五岁儿子。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHVB16NH5lER3naRDBMHNNpr5k1SbN7MK26C28vRSCGjMicthmD2n4YCUg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           小熊的咖啡征程始于2011年，当时农场首次栽种了传统品种铁皮卡、卡杜拉和帕奇；怀着对精品咖啡的热忱，2017年引进了赫赫有名的瑰夏、波旁和帕卡玛拉品种，进一步丰富了农场的咖啡版图。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHVOSVthaljeYfgTs7wbKCe6Ddckz1Gw4EadKS7hNnZMRuf0Eic2iaesV9w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           这份执着与咖啡豆的优异品质逐渐获得认可。2019年，农场的\n          </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           铁皮卡与波旁品种首次参加地区大赛便荣获亚军；2020年更以这两个挚爱的品种在亚马逊大区博览会上勇夺冠军，成就重要里程碑。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHVDnYQpfuzBHqgm4nPc0b5IMKTxHROU8eibTjWfYrSR0oxT7n0LiaAdBsw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           追求卓越的脚步从未停歇，2023年，小熊再度征战亚马逊大区洛尼亚格兰德地区(Lonya Grande) 赛事，这次瑰夏品种大放异彩，摘得桂冠。\n          </span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          2023 Lonya Grande生豆赛冠军\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-size: 16px auto !important;height: 187.85px !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
